# Case: Standalone Quick Panel native window without tray
# Mode: native
# Purpose: Public unic-desktop --quick-panel opens a native Quick Panel window against standalone unicd without tray or GUI, searches and previews text/image/file history, copies to the isolated directory board, focuses without hiding on repeat launch, and keeps unicd and standby panel alive after dismissal.
# Steps:
#   Start standalone unicd in an initialized isolated profile without tray or GUI, submit synthetic text, PNG image, and file history, and invoke public unic-desktop --quick-panel.
#   Verify only unicd and quick-panel processes exist; search and preview stored entries including the satellite flyout; invoke unic-desktop --quick-panel again to verify the window stays open and focused; copy selected content and verify exact directory-board bytes and windowless standby after dismissal.
# Expected:
#   Native Quick Panel window and preview satellite render and record continuous frames without tray or GUI; repeated --quick-panel focuses without closing; Copy writes exact directory-board bytes; dismissal destroys windows while quick-panel and standalone unicd stay alive with distinct PIDs.
# Forbidden:
#   Tray or GUI process creation, system clipboard mutation, physical input claims, hiding on repeated --quick-panel, stopping standalone unicd on panel dismissal, missing screenshots, or missing continuous sampled-window recording.

start-standalone-service
submit standalone-panel-text 'Standalone Quick Panel native text'
submit-image standalone-panel-image
submit-file standalone-panel-file 'standalone-note.txt' 'Standalone panel file body'
public-open-panel
standalone-panel-only-check
ui-wait button '历史：Standalone Quick Panel native text'
ui-set textField '搜索快捷面板' 'Standalone Quick Panel'
ui-wait button '历史：Standalone Quick Panel native text'
role-panel-preview
screenshot standalone-panel-open
public-open-panel-refocus
screenshot standalone-panel-refocused
role-panel-copy
board-equals 'Standalone Quick Panel native text'
role-panel-hidden
standalone-panel-only-check
